// Command `MOVE_CURSOR` ([`RgfxMoveCursor`]): not answered.
#define RGFX_CMD_MOVE_CURSOR 4

// Command `SET_VBLANK` ([`RgfxSetVblank`]): answered by [`RGFX_EVT_COMPLETE`].
